      "summary_en": "Swain unleashes several bolts of eldritch power that pierce through enemies. Enemies hit take more damage for each bolt they are struck by.",
      "summary_zh": "斯维因释放多道恶魔之力，这种力量可以穿透命中的目标。被一道以上的恶魔之力所命中的敌人，会受到基于恶魔之力数量的更多伤害。",
